        <body>
            <div xml:id="d245">

                <pb facs="0514" n="486" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v03/pg486"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">320/8–553: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State at
                            Seoul to the Department of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Seoul</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1953-08-05T21:00:00+09:00">August 5, 1953—9
                            p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Dulte 11. Re Tedul 6. Agree you inform Prince
                        Wan soonest. You should offer Thailand ECOSOC or Trusteeship Council. Do not approve giving our support to
                    Thailand for Security Council. Lodge
                    and I believe current threat to Thai position makes her risky candidate for
                    Security Council. Believe you should move ahead with the Turk candidacy for the
                    Greek seat on SC.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dulles</hi>
                        </signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
